# Certification-guide PDFs - kept locally, not published on GitHub.
# Phase 1/2's docs/ only ever held the PDFs (screenshots.md moved to evidences/),
# same for Phase 3/5. Phase 4's docs/ also holds screenshots.md + screenshots/
# (LocalStack evidence) which DO stay published, so only its PDF is excluded.
